---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: "Contact — {{ profile.name }}"
description: "Get in touch with {{ profile.name }}: professional links and a contact form."
---

<h1>Contact</h1>
<p class="page-lead">Looking to collaborate, share ideas, or build something meaningful together?</p>

<section>
  <h2>Professional Links</h2>
  <ul class="links-grid">
    {% for link in profile.professionalLinks %}
      <li>
        <a href="{{ link.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <img src="{{ link.icon }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
          <span>{{ link.label }}</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
